  "description": "Large file uploads to Azure Blob Storage for ASP.NET Core 2.1 / 2.3, including ASP.NET Core 2.3 on .NET Framework. services.AddLargeFileUploader(Configuration) + app.UseLargeFileUploader() serve an upload API and a ready-made drag & drop browser uploader with chunked uploads, automatic retries, resume and per-file progress and cancel. For ASP.NET Core 3.1+ and classic ASP.NET, use the LargeFileUploader package.",
